    "word": "consummation",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5a95aa2d-d37c-3a37-a8a1-4a970250bd39",
                "word": "consummation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "336f8d04-6997-47e5-a23f-4979242eae67",
                        "entry_id": "5a95aa2d-d37c-3a37-a8a1-4a970250bd39",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "consummations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a0dce7d3-82af-3b8e-ad9c-e12d14c696d5",
                        "entry_id": "5a95aa2d-d37c-3a37-a8a1-4a970250bd39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of consummating, or the state of being consummated; the state of being completed; completion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "90d1a4e9-7b02-46d6-ad0d-9a778d19e40c",
                                "sense_id": "a0dce7d3-82af-3b8e-ad9c-e12d14c696d5",
                                "text": "I emptied my revolver upon him as he lay, and should have done the same with its mate had not two hunters at that moment come upon the ground and prevented any further consummation of my designs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdb73fde-7053-45af-80a9-c622676d9f57",
                                "sense_id": "a0dce7d3-82af-3b8e-ad9c-e12d14c696d5",
                                "text": "The opening of the extension from Brentwood to Colchester took place on March 29, 1843, when it was reported that at Colchester \"the town had literally turned out its population to witness the consummation of the hopes and the fears of alike friends and opponents.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0956568a-6af8-44c7-a31f-4cd193d503a4",
                                "sense_id": "a0dce7d3-82af-3b8e-ad9c-e12d14c696d5",
                                "text": "It was the consummation of plans designed on Tufton Street, and of an alliance with Ms. Truss stretching back years. Under her watch, Britain has become a libertarian laboratory."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3c23d7e8-b71b-3e71-b6b6-7dea5457613a",
                        "entry_id": "5a95aa2d-d37c-3a37-a8a1-4a970250bd39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The first act of sexual intercourse in a relationship, particularly the first such act following marriage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2e81950-d337-49bd-90aa-2c0a9e6e22ed",
                                "sense_id": "3c23d7e8-b71b-3e71-b6b6-7dea5457613a",
                                "text": "The consummation of marriage involves the mightiest issues of life and is the most holy and sacred right recognized by man, and it is the Balm of Gilead for many ills. Masturbation or prostitution soon blight the brightest prospects a young man may have."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eced5d6f-05cf-3299-ba30-def5f4109c31",
                        "entry_id": "5a95aa2d-d37c-3a37-a8a1-4a970250bd39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The achievement of perfection."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4768ed0e-5c7b-47ac-a1f4-81d3273b0e3a",
                                "sense_id": "eced5d6f-05cf-3299-ba30-def5f4109c31",
                                "text": "He had no vague false notions of beginning fires in November, and ending them in May; but had arrived at the philosophical conclusion, that there are very few evenings, in all the year, that a fire is not a consummation of domestic felicity in England most devoutly to be wished."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ef5b294-5d5e-38b2-a404-6f978efa227f",
                        "entry_id": "5a95aa2d-d37c-3a37-a8a1-4a970250bd39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Termination; the end (as of the world or of life); an end or resulting state."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1efac624-c756-4f37-bdf9-febc61282d8d",
                                "sense_id": "5ef5b294-5d5e-38b2-a404-6f978efa227f",
                                "text": "Teaching them to observe all things whatsoever I have commanded you: and behold I am with you all days, even to the consummation of the world."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dbe4876c-20b4-45bc-8c80-f5809648d10a",
                                "sense_id": "5ef5b294-5d5e-38b2-a404-6f978efa227f",
                                "text": "It may be supposed that from the spread of information all real danger from ignorance is past. Not so, good reader, that is a consummation as yet \"devoutly to be wished.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e6619b4c-1559-35a2-9356-a7425be0be5a",
                        "entry_id": "5a95aa2d-d37c-3a37-a8a1-4a970250bd39",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The date at which the mortgagor becomes contractually obligated to the mortgagee in a real estate transaction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9adf6ad2-7c20-4b82-a471-1f7fab737d6a",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a95aa2d-d37c-3a37-a8a1-4a970250bd39",
                        "source_sense_description": "The act of consummating",
                        "target_lang_word": "Vollendung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Vollendung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b71c5cc-dfb2-3563-80a8-33b028ad81fc",
                                        "entry_id": "32e9f01f-ebef-359a-9a63-30b38457d9da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "das Abschließen oder Fertigstellen von etwas"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "681277c9-6755-44d8-b8ad-c123043a1f74",
                                                "sense_id": "7b71c5cc-dfb2-3563-80a8-33b028ad81fc",
                                                "text": "Das Team feiert die Vollendung ihres großen Projektes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af62b819-6d3a-472b-afb5-cff3052be149",
                                                "sense_id": "7b71c5cc-dfb2-3563-80a8-33b028ad81fc",
                                                "text": "Mit Vollendung des 18. Lebensjahres erlangt man die Mündigkeit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19416654-1173-40f7-b6b2-6d168f254b8a",
                                                "sense_id": "7b71c5cc-dfb2-3563-80a8-33b028ad81fc",
                                                "text": "„In absehbarer Zeit soll die steinerne Kuppel fertig sein und die Silhouette der Frauenkirche damit kurz vor der Vollendung stehen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5ebf05e-3279-408b-b832-e1ccc924ac1e",
                                                "sense_id": "7b71c5cc-dfb2-3563-80a8-33b028ad81fc",
                                                "text": "„Ein Tod mit siebzehn Jahren ist nicht Vollendung, sondern Abbruch.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b2633fe-1a32-4c49-af8d-88a593b8b072",
                                                "sense_id": "7b71c5cc-dfb2-3563-80a8-33b028ad81fc",
                                                "text": "„Auch der Turm, an dessen Bau die Bewohner der Stadt emotional den meisten Anteil genommen haben, steht kurz vor der Vollendung: der neue Henninger Turm.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1941ad2-9a89-48b8-8a2e-6e78c44eb89a",
                                                "sense_id": "7b71c5cc-dfb2-3563-80a8-33b028ad81fc",
                                                "text": "„Dreißig Jahre nach Vollendung der Einheit sind Ostdeutsche in Führungspositionen in Wirtschaft und Gesellschaft in Deutschland noch immer dramatisch unterrepräsentiert, außerdem ist der Transformationsprozess in den ostdeutschen Ländern, der auf die Einheit folgte, noch immer nicht in seiner Bedeutung erkannt und als Anregung verstanden worden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cff86e2e-f0c7-4652-999c-684ac26b1e99",
                                                "sense_id": "7b71c5cc-dfb2-3563-80a8-33b028ad81fc",
                                                "text": "„In dem Urteil wird noch einmal festgestellt, dass Kinder von der Vollendung des ersten Lebensjahres an einen gesetzlichen Anspruch auf frühkindliche Förderung in einer Tageseinrichtung oder Kindertagespflege haben.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "138069c9-5cc5-36b5-b0a3-fe7571ef7ded",
                                        "entry_id": "32e9f01f-ebef-359a-9a63-30b38457d9da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eigenschaft, vollkommen, also perfekt zu sein"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b8edb52-6ef2-4369-b027-fc004b2c851e",
                                                "sense_id": "138069c9-5cc5-36b5-b0a3-fe7571ef7ded",
                                                "text": "„Wir streben nach Vollendung und sehen dabei schon ganz fertig aus.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "211349be-525b-40de-81e8-5e4bec37c92a",
                                                "sense_id": "138069c9-5cc5-36b5-b0a3-fe7571ef7ded",
                                                "text": "„Vor dem Hintergrund der Vollendung und Stärkung des europäischen Binnenmarktes gebe es nun ‚eine riesige Chance für einen koordinierten Lösungsansatz‘, heißt es in dem Brief.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "132ac19c-746a-4740-8c3b-f5dd54d71ed7",
                                                "sense_id": "138069c9-5cc5-36b5-b0a3-fe7571ef7ded",
                                                "text": "„Die symbolträchtige Sieben, oft mit Glück und Vollendung oder in Erinnerung an den siebten Tag der Schöpfungsgeschichte mit erholsamer Ruhe assoziiert, ist hier nur der vorläufige Höhepunkt der Unerträglichkeit.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f719b4d0-310f-3b18-9bb8-e43c79d530ce",
                                        "entry_id": "32e9f01f-ebef-359a-9a63-30b38457d9da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Deliktsstadium, in dem alle Merkmale des Straftatbestandes vorliegen, objektive und subjektiv"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Strafrecht"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7267c7b-a18f-4e8e-99f1-5ec2696b8844",
                                                "sense_id": "f719b4d0-310f-3b18-9bb8-e43c79d530ce",
                                                "text": "„Für das gesamte Jahr 2018 wurden in NRW den Angaben zufolge 289 Vollendungen mit einem Sachschaden von rund 12,4 Millionen Euro registriert.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
